Subject: [PATCH 207/230] fix(feed): pill Choose button and 8px spacing rhythm
 on the feed top
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The "Choose" link was a flat block glued to the banner's edge and the feed
top stacked 12, 10 and 6px gaps between banner, group headers and cards.

Choose is now a 36px pill with a 44px hit band inside a 48px banner, and
every gap on the feed top sits on the 8px grid: 12px under the header and
the strip, 16px around group headers, 8px inside a group. The league chip
row loses its -my-1 compensation, which was eating 4px of the gap to the
first group header.

